WEBVTT

00:02:29.676 --> 00:02:31.556
no one should ever die of hunger.

00:02:32.036 --> 00:02:35.796
I feel like I owe it to my baby brother
to be better and do better,

00:02:35.836 --> 00:02:38.276
so I can help people like us,

00:02:38.316 --> 00:02:41.196
whether from Darfur
or anywhere in the world.

00:02:42.116 --> 00:02:43.276
I have big dreams,

00:02:43.276 --> 00:02:46.756
and I know education
is my path to reaching them.

00:02:47.636 --> 00:02:51.636
Education is a basic right
for every child.

00:02:52.556 --> 00:02:56.916
And it is the way
each of us can get skills,

00:02:56.956 --> 00:03:01.196
tools and power to make
change in our lives